---
const rows = [
  {
    name: 'FCFS',
    intervals: [
      [0, 6, 'P1'],
      [6, 9, 'P2'],
      [9, 11, 'P3'],
      [11, 15, 'P4'],
    ],
  },
  {
    name: 'SJF',
    intervals: [
      [0, 2, 'P3'],
      [2, 5, 'P2'],
      [5, 9, 'P4'],
      [9, 15, 'P1'],
    ],
  },
  {
    name: 'RR, q=3',
    intervals: [
      [0, 3, 'P1'],
      [3, 6, 'P2'],
      [6, 8, 'P3'],
      [8, 11, 'P4'],
      [11, 14, 'P1'],
      [14, 15, 'P4'],
    ],
  },
];
---

<figure>
  <div
    class="timeline"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Cronogramas de CPU, deslocáveis horizontalmente"
  >
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 600 225"
      role="img"
      aria-label="FCFS, SJF e Round Robin para P1, P2, P3 e P4, todos chegados em zero, com rajadas 6, 3, 2 e 4. Cada linha cobre 15 unidades de tempo."
    >
      {rows.map((row, index) => {
        const y = 12 + index * 70;
        return (
          <g>
            <text x="5" y={y + 20} fill="currentColor" font-size="14">
              {row.name}
            </text>
            {row.intervals.map(([start, end, name]) => (
              <g>
                <rect
                  x={100 + Number(start) * 32}
                  y={y}
                  width={(Number(end) - Number(start)) * 32}
                  height="32"
                  fill="var(--surface)"
                  stroke="var(--accent)"
                />
                <text
                  x={100 + (Number(start) + Number(end)) * 16}
                  y={y + 21}
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  font-size="14"
                >
                  {name}
                </text>
                <text
                  x={100 + Number(start) * 32}
                  y={y + 49}
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  font-size="12"
                >
                  {start}
                </text>
              </g>
            ))}
            <text
              x="580"
              y={y + 49}
              text-anchor="middle"
              fill="currentColor"
              font-size="12"
            >
              15
            </text>
          </g>
        );
      })}
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Cada retângulo é um intervalo de CPU. Face a FCFS, Round Robin antecipa o
    primeiro serviço de P2, P3 e P4, mas faz P1 voltar à fila.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  figure {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .timeline {
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 4px;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 550px;
  }
  .timeline:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  @media print {
    svg {
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
